<span class="bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">dev</span>
<span class="bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">pipeline</span>

</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0">
